    "titulo": "Casa Azul",
    "bajada": "La Casa Azul es un centro municipal de atención integral, gratuita y especializada para personas dentro de la Condición del Espectro Autista (CEA), sus familias y cuidadores. Brinda servicios médicos, terapéuticos, educativos y legales, con un enfoque inclusivo y multidisciplinario.",
    "cuerpo": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins;\">Atenci&oacute;n m&eacute;dica y terap&eacute;utica</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Diagn&oacute;stico oportuno en neurodesarrollo</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Terapias:</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Psicolog&iacute;a </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Fonoaudiolog&iacute;a</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Kinesiolog&iacute;a </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">M&eacute;dico especialista en neurodesarrollo </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Psicomotricidad </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Nutrici&oacute;n </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Acompa&ntilde;ante terap&eacute;utico </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Estimulaci&oacute;n temprana </span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Psicopedagog&iacute;a</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Seguimiento individual seg&uacute;n el perfil y necesidades de cada paciente</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins;\">Espacios terap&eacute;uticos especializados</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Consultorios adaptados para atenci&oacute;n cl&iacute;nica y terap&eacute;utica</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Sala multisensorial para autorregulaci&oacute;n, estimulaci&oacute;n sensorial y reducci&oacute;n de ansiedad</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Sala motora para el desarrollo f&iacute;sico, equilibrio y coordinaci&oacute;n</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Ambientes dise&ntilde;ados para minimizar la hipersensibilidad sensorial (luz, sonido y est&iacute;mulos)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins;\">Acompa&ntilde;amiento a familias y cuidadores</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Orientaci&oacute;n y contenci&oacute;n familiar</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Escuela de Padres, con intercambio de experiencias y estrategias pr&aacute;cticas</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Apoyo emocional y educativo para fortalecer el rol de la familia en los procesos terap&eacute;uticos</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins;\">Asesoramiento legal</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Orientaci&oacute;n jur&iacute;dica sobre derechos de las personas con CEA</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Asistencia en la gesti&oacute;n de beneficios y tr&aacute;mites vinculados a la condici&oacute;n</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins;\">Capacitaci&oacute;n y formaci&oacute;n</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Talleres y capacitaciones gratuitas para:</span></li>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"circle\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l3 level2 lfo5; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Familias y cuidadores</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l3 level2 lfo5; tab-stops: list 72.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Profesionales</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Programas de desarrollo de habilidades sociales, emocionales y cognitivas</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">Sala de Usos M&uacute;ltiples (SUM) para actividades grupales, talleres y encuentros formativos</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins;\">Trabajo interdisciplinario</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Poppins; color: #000000;\">La atenci&oacute;n est&aacute; a cargo de un <strong>equipo multidisciplinario especializado</strong>, integrado por m&eacute;dicos, psic&oacute;logos, fonoaudi&oacute;logos, nutricionistas, enfermeros, psicopedagogos, terapistas ocupacionales, acompa&ntilde;antes terap&eacute;uticos, docentes y asesores legales.</span></p>",
